    {
      "id": "claim_ace378f716294ff5ac21a0469928a00e",
      "statement": "Each committed SQLite write is captured as LTX data by celld-ltx, a from-scratch Rust reimplementation of Litestream v0.5.11 with the LTX v0.5.2 block format; a managed Db per resident cell diffs the real WAL against the last LTX position and writes the next L0 LTX file.",
