    {
      "id": "claim_8c2002cca6794fdabfed500bd540fea5",
      "statement": "Replicated data is stored under cells/<cell>/ltx/e<epoch>/ in the bucket, mirroring the local watch directory tree; the epoch in the key is the fence, so a node that lost ownership writes only into a superseded prefix.",
