      "statement": "CELLD_DURABILITY selects how a write is proved durable and defaults to fleet; a single node waits for the bucket upload, while a fleet of two or more nodes sends each write to one or two followers and acknowledges as soon as they hold it on disk or the bucket upload proves it.",
